<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jostens rating raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jostens rating raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Barrington Research Associates Inc said Wednesday it had raised its rating on Jostens Inc to strong buy from long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Alexander Paris Jr in a report cited prospects for strong growth immediately ahead.</p>
<p>-- He noted that during the second quarter ended December 31 the company completed the closing of two small Canadian facilities. Jostens said it was likely there would be further plant consolidations over the next two years.</p>
<p>-- Jostens was up 3/8 at 20-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
